{
  "building_name": "DTI Headquarters",
  "description": "The DTI houses a powerful temporal matter converter that unlocks the power to transmute materials. The Material Converter applies high concentrations of tachyon energy to artificially refine the material, converting it into different types of the same grade and rarity For example, G4 Rare Ore -> G4 Rare Crystal. It also has the ability to convert materials into different rarities of the same type and grade! For example, G4 Uncommon Crystal -> G4 Rare Crystal.\n\nThis technology is unstable and requires additional investment before safeties can be lifted higher grades of materials can be refined. Grade 4 is available at level 30, Grade 5 is available at Level 40, Grade 6 is available at Level 50.\n\nA recurring claim of Bonus Converter Tokens is unlocked at level 40. These can be used with Bonus Converter Refineries which have no tax and no cooldown. A one time claim of 5 tokens is unlocked at levels 20, 30, 50, 60 and 70.",
